{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf66\ud83c\udf2d Welcome to <strong>Summer Delicious Simulator</strong>, the ultimate city street-food experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey as a <strong>humble hotdog or ice cream vendor</strong>, roaming through the lively streets of a vibrant summer city. Earn money, upgrade your cart, and turn your small food stall into one of the city\u2019s most popular hangout spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During <strong>special events and crowded festival days</strong>, seize the opportunity serve faster, earn more, and rise above your competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you\u2019re not alone in the city. Compete with other players and friends who run their own food carts in the same area. Use your strategy, timing, and upgrades to attract their customers and dominate the marketplace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you become the <strong>most famous street food master</strong> in town?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161620/extras/85ffe47253c152208417d67752b164b0.poster.avif?t=1763408903\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161620/extras/85ffe47253c152208417d67752b164b0.webm?t=1763408903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161620/extras/85ffe47253c152208417d67752b164b0.mp4?t=1763408903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161620/extras/c342699c2222db10c91e1a0f5518a408.poster.avif?t=1763408903\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161620/extras/c342699c222